69
00:03:51.367 --> 00:03:53.877
My next step is to read more in English.

70
00:03:54.967 --> 00:03:58.934
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

71
00:03:59.783 --> 00:04:01.481
I blank improved my writing.

72
00:04:01.781 --> 00:04:04.610
A, have. B, has. C, am.

73
00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:09.888
The answer is A: have.

74
00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:13.166
Improvement over time is blank.

75
00:04:13.466 --> 00:04:17.351
A, progress. B, challenge. C, review.

76
00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.410
The answer is A: progress.

77
00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:26.387
Believing in yourself is blank.

78
00:04:26.687 --> 00:04:30.480
A, confidence. B, speaking. C, skill.

79
00:04:34.033 --> 00:04:36.312
The answer is A: confidence.

80
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.779
