83
00:04:54.169 --> 00:05:02.057
My speaking has improved most. I have spoken English every week, and now I can talk about my hobbies, my town and my future.

84
00:05:02.357 --> 00:05:04.148
Excellent answer, Visal!

85
00:05:05.050 --> 00:05:09.397
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and present perfect (i have improved).

86
00:05:09.697 --> 00:05:13.720
Today's value is reflection. Think about what you learned and how you grew.

87
00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:20.007
